WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.761 --> 00:00:13.330
Wukong shouted outside the cave.

2
00:00:14.311 --> 00:00:18.054
He shouted all kinds of insults about the Demon of Power.

3
00:00:19.135 --> 00:00:21.097
Inside the cave the guard woke up.

4
00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:24.079
He ran to the demon's bedroom.

5
00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.262
"Master!" cried the guard.

6
00:00:27.282 --> 00:00:28.964
"The monkey is back!"

7
00:00:32.336 --> 00:00:34.337
the middle of the night," said the demon.

8
00:00:34.357 --> 00:00:36.157
"What does he want?"

9
00:00:36.317 --> 00:00:40.058
"He said we must return the queen," said the guard.

10
00:00:40.078 --> 00:00:43.199
"If we don't, he'll smash our entire mountain.

11
00:00:44.119 --> 00:00:46.320
He also yelled some terrible things about you."

12
00:00:48.941 --> 00:00:52.281
The Demon of Power climbed out of bed and grabbed the fake bells.

13
00:00:52.301 --> 00:00:57.443
"I'll chase the monkey away with my fire, smoke, and sand again."

14
00:00:58.463 --> 00:01:01.204
He tied the bells around his neck and went outside.

15
00:01:03.589 --> 00:01:05.030
demon glared at Wukong.

16
00:01:05.050 --> 00:01:06.431
"Go away!

17
00:01:07.352 --> 00:01:08.392
I'm sleeping!"

18
00:01:09.553 --> 00:01:11.134
"Return the queen!"

19
00:01:11.514 --> 00:01:12.295
shouted the monkey.

20
00:01:14.456 --> 00:01:15.197
said the demon.

21
00:01:15.937 --> 00:01:17.659
He reached for the bells around his neck.

22
00:01:18.479 --> 00:01:20.520
Wukong pretended to be surprised.

23
00:01:20.540 --> 00:01:22.322
"Oh," he said.

24
00:01:22.342 --> 00:01:25.023
"I have bells just like those."

25
00:01:26.664 --> 00:01:28.226
The demon squinted at the monkey.

26
00:01:29.727 --> 00:01:31.668
doubt your bells are like mine.

27
00:01:32.264 --> 00:01:34.966
Let me see them."

28
00:01:35.466 --> 00:01:36.307
held up the bells.

29
00:01:38.108 --> 00:01:39.929
The demon peered at them for a moment.

30
00:01:41.130 --> 00:01:42.871
bells do look like mine.

31
00:01:44.452 --> 00:01:46.634
But my bells are magic."

32
00:01:46.714 --> 00:01:49.776
"So are mine," said Wukong.

33
00:01:49.796 --> 00:01:58.202
"My bells can make fire, smoke, and sand," said the demon.

34
00:01:59.643 --> 00:02:01.564
interesting." Wukong smiled.

35
00:02:02.096 --> 00:02:03.397
"My bells can do that too."

36
00:02:04.618 --> 00:02:08.300
"Really?" The Demon of Power looked surprised.

37
00:02:08.320 --> 00:02:12.804
"Let's compare bells to see whose work better."

38
00:02:12.824 --> 00:02:15.065
"Okay," said Wukong.

39
00:02:15.605 --> 00:02:16.406
"You go first."

40
00:02:18.768 --> 00:02:21.009
was planning to," said the demon.

41
00:02:21.710 --> 00:02:22.730
He shook his bells.

42
00:02:25.492 --> 00:02:26.333
Nothing happened.

43
00:02:29.355 --> 00:02:30.356
shook the bells again.

44
00:02:31.824 --> 00:02:33.084
Again nothing happened.

45
00:02:34.845 --> 00:02:36.585
strange," the demon mumbled.

46
00:02:37.526 --> 00:02:39.106
He looked closely at the bells.

47
00:02:40.226 --> 00:02:42.587
"These bells worked fine yesterday."

48
00:02:46.008 --> 00:02:47.248
tried not to laugh.

49
00:02:47.268 --> 00:02:50.269
"Let's see if my bells work," he said.

50
00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:52.670
The monkey shook the bells.

51
00:02:56.871 --> 00:02:59.552
Fire, smoke, and sand rushed toward the demon.

52
00:03:02.601 --> 00:03:03.381
cried the demon.

53
00:03:04.061 --> 00:03:06.062
He covered his face and fell to the ground.

54
00:03:06.983 --> 00:03:10.444
Wukong pulled out his iron bar and got ready to strike.

55
00:03:10.464 --> 00:03:12.945
"Wukong, stop!"

56
00:03:13.285 --> 00:03:14.085
shouted a voice.

57
00:03:14.966 --> 00:03:18.647
The monkey looked up and saw Guanyin coming down from the sky.

58
00:03:20.608 --> 00:03:21.548
Wukong bowed.

59
00:03:21.568 --> 00:03:23.529
"Greetings, Bodhisattva.

60
00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:26.170
I was just going to destroy this demon."

61
00:03:26.190 --> 00:03:30.892
"You must not harm him," said Guanyin.

62
00:03:31.112 --> 00:03:31.753
my pet wolf.

63
00:03:32.353 --> 00:03:33.434
He escaped from Heaven."

64
00:03:34.814 --> 00:03:36.455
bodhisattva looked at the demon.

65
00:03:36.475 --> 00:03:39.036
"Return to your true form!"

66
00:03:40.277 --> 00:03:43.899
Light sparkled, and the demon turned into a huge wolf.

67
00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:48.341
Guanyin climbed onto the wolf's back.

68
00:03:49.502 --> 00:03:51.943
She looked at the wolf's neck and then at Wukong.

69
00:03:51.963 --> 00:03:54.425
"Give me the bells, Wukong."

70
00:03:56.186 --> 00:03:57.246
"What bells?"

71
00:03:58.267 --> 00:04:00.528
Wukong held the bells behind his back.

72
00:04:01.524 --> 00:04:04.946
"My wolf wears a set of three bells," said Guanyin.

73
00:04:05.887 --> 00:04:06.787
know you have them.

74
00:04:07.127 --> 00:04:09.329
You could not have defeated the wolf without them."

75
00:04:10.409 --> 00:04:11.310
Wukong shrugged.

76
00:04:11.330 --> 00:04:16.733
"I have no idea what you're—" them over," said Guanyin.

77
00:04:16.753 --> 00:04:20.015
"Or I'll recite the Tight Headband spell."

78
00:04:22.336 --> 00:04:22.996
no need for that!"

79
00:04:23.216 --> 00:04:23.997
cried the monkey.

80
00:04:25.097 --> 00:04:25.878
"I was just joking!"

81
00:04:26.758 --> 00:04:29.240
Grinning sheepishly, he handed over the bells.

82
00:04:30.220 --> 00:04:34.982
Guanyin tied the bells around the wolf's neck and then rode up into the sky.

83
00:04:39.824 --> 00:04:42.785
Back at the palace, the king and queen were reunited.

84
00:04:42.805 --> 00:04:48.527
"Thank you for rescuing the queen, Sun Wukong," said the king.

85
00:04:48.547 --> 00:04:54.690
"Tonight we will hold a feast to thank you and your companions," said the queen.

86
00:04:56.411 --> 00:04:59.512
That night the royal banquet hall was filled with people.

87
00:05:00.720 --> 00:05:08.567
Servants carried trays filled with rice, vegetables, mushrooms, noodles, tofu, dumplings, and other food.

88
00:05:10.348 --> 00:05:12.750
Bajie ate everything in front of him.

89
00:05:12.771 --> 00:05:17.014
"Would you like more steamed buns?"

90
00:05:17.434 --> 00:05:18.215
asked a servant.

91
00:05:18.235 --> 00:05:21.958
"You don't need to ask," said the pig.

92
00:05:21.978 --> 00:05:25.041
"Just put food in front of me, and I'll eat it!"
